      "versionNonce": 1110132484,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793391132099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every card has different limits (SM count, max threads per block,\nregisters, shared memory, warp size, clock memory). Don't hard-code them;\nask the driver at run time.\n\nCUDA C++: `cudaGetDeviceCount` for how many GPUs, then\n`cudaGetDeviceProperties(&prop, i)` for each.\n\nUseful fields: `multiProcessorCount`, `maxThreadPerBlock`, \n`maxThreadsDim`, `maxGridSize`, `regsPerBlock`, `sharedMemPerBlock`,\n`warpSize`, `clockrate`.\n\nUse them to size grids and blocks, and to work out occupancy\nfor this card.",
      "fontSize": 21.292307692307702,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every card has different limits (SM count, max threads per block,\nregisters, shared memory, warp size, clock memory). Don't hard-code them;\nask the driver at run time.\n\nCUDA C++: `cudaGetDeviceCount` for how many GPUs, then\n`cudaGetDeviceProperties(&prop, i)` for each.\n\nUseful fields: `multiProcessorCount`, `maxThreadPerBlock`, \n`maxThreadsDim`, `maxGridSize`, `regsPerBlock`, `sharedMemPerBlock`,\n`warpSize`, `clockrate`.\n\nUse them to size grids and blocks, and to work out occupancy\nfor this card.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
